# Prettier formats code and config (`pnpm run format`; CI runs `pnpm run format:check`).
# Writing, generated data, lockfiles and hand-tuned HTML stay as they are, and so does CSS:
# it is written one rule per line, which Prettier would spread over four times the lines
# (.prettierrc.json leaves the <style> and <script> blocks in .astro files alone for the
# same reason, and because inline scripts ship byte for byte). .gitignore'd paths are
# skipped as well.
